  nameEnglish: Crimson Death
  descriptionEnglish: The Crimson Death is a weapon of immense power, crafted by
    the legendary demon hunter Dageron the Powerful. The gun is named for its deep
    red color, which matches the hue of Dageron's iconic outfit.
  nameChinese: "\u6B7B\u4EA1\u706B\u67AA"
  descriptionChinese: "\u6B7B\u4EA1\u706B\u67AA\u662F\u7531\u4F20\u5947\u6076\u9B54\u730E\u4EBA\u8FBE\u683C\u9F99\u7CBE\u5FC3\u6253\u9020\u7684\u8D85\u5F3A\u6B66\u5668\u3002\u8FD9\u628A\u67AA\u4EE5\u8FBE\u683C\u9F99\u6807\u5FD7\u6027\u7684\u6DF1\u7EA2\u8863\u7740\u547D\u540D\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Morte Carmesim
  descriptionPortuguese: "A Morte Carmesim \xE9 uma arma de imenso poder, criada
    pelo lend\xE1rio ca\xE7ador de dem\xF4nios Dageron, o Poderoso. A arma \xE9 nomeada
    por sua cor vermelho intenso, que combina com o tom do ic\xF4nico traje de Dageron."
  nameSpanish: "Muerte Carmes\xED"
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "La Muerte Carmes\xED es un arma de inmenso poder, creada
    por el legendario cazador de demonios Dageron el Poderoso. La pistola recibe
    su nombre por su color rojo intenso, que coincide con el tono del ic\xF3nico
    atuendo de Dageron."
